WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.077 --> 00:00:02.234
-Welcome, welcome, welcome,
welcome to

00:00:02.234 --> 00:00:04.036
"The Tonight Show."

00:00:04.036 --> 00:00:06.239
You made it.
You're watching.

00:00:06.239 --> 00:00:08.641
[ Cheering, whistling,
and applause ]

00:00:08.641 --> 00:00:10.876
Well, guys, this is big news --

00:00:10.876 --> 00:00:13.245
for the first time
in over a year,

00:00:13.245 --> 00:00:17.182
New York City has resumed
24-hour subway service.

00:00:17.182 --> 00:00:20.887
[ Cheering and applause ]

00:00:20.887 --> 00:00:22.488
That's right, the subways are

00:00:22.488 --> 00:00:25.091
once again running
24 hours a day,

00:00:25.091 --> 00:00:27.493
minus the 23 hours
they're out of service,

00:00:27.493 --> 00:00:29.695
[ Laughter ]
but, still.

00:00:29.695 --> 00:00:31.464
That's right,
the subway's running 24 hours.

00:00:31.464 --> 00:00:33.432
This is great news
for the city, but,

00:00:33.432 --> 00:00:35.167
a tough break
for all the rat weddings

00:00:35.167 --> 00:00:37.002
that are scheduled
between 2:00 and 4:00 am.

00:00:37.002 --> 00:00:38.505
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:00:38.505 --> 00:00:39.905
Unfortunate.

00:00:39.905 --> 00:00:41.907
Do you guys remember
simpler times in New York City,

00:00:41.907 --> 00:00:44.744
when the biggest health crisis
was a pole on the 7 train?

00:00:44.744 --> 00:00:46.712
[ Laughter ]

00:00:46.712 --> 00:00:48.347
Touch that thing.

00:00:48.347 --> 00:00:50.583
I'd rather fall into someone
than touch that pole.

00:00:50.583 --> 00:00:51.884
[ Laughter ]

00:00:51.884 --> 00:00:54.487
That's right, there's the A,
there's the B, the C,

00:00:54.487 --> 00:00:56.055
a bunch of other types
of hepatitis

00:00:56.055 --> 00:00:57.123
you can get on the subway.

00:00:57.123 --> 00:00:59.559
Just be careful
when you grab that pole.

00:00:59.559 --> 00:01:02.662
[ Laughter ]

00:01:02.662 --> 00:01:04.497
Speaking of New York,
the Brooklyn Nets are

00:01:04.497 --> 00:01:06.065
in the NBA playoffs.

00:01:06.065 --> 00:01:07.700
-Oh! Wow!

00:01:07.700 --> 00:01:11.471
[ Cheering and applause ]

00:01:11.471 --> 00:01:13.906
They're in the NBA playoffs
and Mayor Bill de Blasio

00:01:13.906 --> 00:01:16.208
showed his team spirit
while announcing

00:01:16.208 --> 00:01:18.611
that their arena will also be
a vaccination site.

00:01:18.611 --> 00:01:20.480
Check out how he was dressed.

00:01:20.480 --> 00:01:25.685
-The Nets are now going to be
joining the battle against COVID

00:01:25.685 --> 00:01:29.522
with a mobile vaccination site
right outside Barclays Center.

00:01:29.522 --> 00:01:32.991
[ Laughter ]

00:01:32.991 --> 00:01:34.126
Right now, Jay-Z is like,

00:01:34.126 --> 00:01:35.994
"Thank God I sold my piece
of the Nets."

00:01:35.994 --> 00:01:38.731
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:01:38.731 --> 00:01:40.433
He looks like a guy
who sits courtside

00:01:40.433 --> 00:01:42.035
and can't get any high-fives
from the players.

00:01:42.035 --> 00:01:43.102
You know that guy?

00:01:43.102 --> 00:01:45.504
[ Laughter ]

00:01:45.504 --> 00:01:48.574
Yeah, the classic basketball fan
outfit -- hat, jersey,

00:01:48.574 --> 00:01:52.378
and a blue button-down
over the jersey.

00:01:52.378 --> 00:01:54.680
I don't think I've ever
seen anyone wear that

00:01:54.680 --> 00:01:58.584
[ Laughter ]
in my life, ever

00:01:58.584 --> 00:02:00.086
You don't think there'd be
someone in the office

00:02:00.086 --> 00:02:01.554
to go like, "Anh...

00:02:01.554 --> 00:02:03.690
Why don't you put the jersey
over the shirt, maybe?

00:02:03.690 --> 00:02:05.090
Ah, you know what?

00:02:05.090 --> 00:02:06.659
Put the shirt over the jersey."

00:02:06.659 --> 00:02:08.060
[ Laughter ]
-The first thing you do is,
"Are you alright?"

00:02:08.060 --> 00:02:09.595
You know, "Are you okay?"
-That's the fashion version

00:02:09.595 --> 00:02:11.897
of an air ball, you know?
[ Laughter ]

00:02:11.897 --> 00:02:14.434
Rob Lowe looked more natural
at the NFC Championship

00:02:14.434 --> 00:02:16.669
and he was just --

00:02:16.669 --> 00:02:18.304
I guess he was rooting
for football, there.

00:02:18.304 --> 00:02:20.573
[ Laughter ]

00:02:20.573 --> 00:02:21.841
Speaking of vaccination sites,

00:02:21.841 --> 00:02:24.209
later this week,
a strip club in Las Vegas

00:02:24.209 --> 00:02:26.211
will be offering
the COVID vaccine.

00:02:26.211 --> 00:02:28.147
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:02:28.147 --> 00:02:29.615
Alright,
now, we're up to two poles

00:02:29.615 --> 00:02:30.984
you shouldn't
put your hands on, okay?

00:02:30.984 --> 00:02:32.585
[ Laughter ]

00:02:32.585 --> 00:02:35.154
That's right, the strip club is
the only vaccination site

00:02:35.154 --> 00:02:37.122
where you leave
and still need to get tested.

00:02:37.122 --> 00:02:38.191
You know what I'm saying?

00:02:38.191 --> 00:02:40.093
[ Laughter ]

00:02:40.093 --> 00:02:41.960
That's right,
when you walk into the club,

00:02:41.960 --> 00:02:43.129
there's a sign that says,

00:02:43.129 --> 00:02:44.563
"Two-dose minimum,"
you know what I'm saying?

00:02:44.563 --> 00:02:46.599
[ Laughter ]
The idea makes sense.

00:02:46.599 --> 00:02:47.900
If we're being honest,
the vaccines

00:02:47.900 --> 00:02:49.502
do kind of sound
like stripper names, like,

00:02:49.502 --> 00:02:52.104
"Put your hands together
for Moderna!"

00:02:52.104 --> 00:02:54.073
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:02:54.073 --> 00:02:55.774
[ Vuvuzela blasts ]

00:02:55.774 --> 00:02:59.078
[ Cheering and applause ]

00:02:59.078 --> 00:03:00.613
Well, guys, COVID restrictions

00:03:00.613 --> 00:03:02.081
are being lifted
around the country,

00:03:02.081 --> 00:03:04.116
which means people are finally
getting out for the first time

00:03:04.116 --> 00:03:06.519
in over a year
and a lot of us have forgotten

00:03:06.519 --> 00:03:09.088
what's normal behavior
and what's not.

00:03:09.088 --> 00:03:10.556
For example,
it's normal for things

00:03:10.556 --> 00:03:12.392
to get a little stressful
at the grocery store

00:03:12.392 --> 00:03:15.494
when it's busy,
but it's not normal doing this.

00:03:15.494 --> 00:03:17.863
-Police say a fight broke out
between two women

00:03:17.863 --> 00:03:19.498
in the potato chip aisle.

00:03:19.498 --> 00:03:21.100
Security footage caught
one woman

00:03:21.100 --> 00:03:22.534
hitting the woman in the face

00:03:22.534 --> 00:03:25.838
with a 10-pound log
of prepackaged meat.

00:03:25.838 --> 00:03:31.377
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:03:31.377 --> 00:03:32.778
Also, with the weather
warming up,

00:03:32.778 --> 00:03:34.881
it's normal if you want to go
outside and hang out.

00:03:34.881 --> 00:03:36.916
What's not normal
is doing it like this.

00:03:36.916 --> 00:03:38.984
-One South Florida man tried
to tell police

00:03:38.984 --> 00:03:40.452
he was just hanging out.

00:03:40.452 --> 00:03:43.623
The only problem was he was
relaxing on a traffic light.

00:03:43.623 --> 00:03:49.562
[ Laughter ]

00:03:49.562 --> 00:03:52.665
Finally, it's totally normal
to start traveling again, okay?

00:03:52.665 --> 00:03:54.733
What's not normal
is doing this.

00:03:54.733 --> 00:03:57.470
-A Colorado man is facing
federal charges this morning,

00:03:57.470 --> 00:03:59.872
accused of disrupting
an Alaska Airlines flight

00:03:59.872 --> 00:04:01.240
by refusing to wear a mask

00:04:01.240 --> 00:04:03.408
and then urinating in the cabin.

00:04:03.408 --> 00:04:08.414
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:04:08.414 --> 00:04:09.515
-Oh, my God.

00:04:09.515 --> 00:04:10.683
-He was pissed.

00:04:10.683 --> 00:04:14.520
[ Laughter ]

00:04:14.520 --> 00:04:15.822
-Some news out of Washington --

00:04:15.822 --> 00:04:18.691
last night, President Biden
released his tax returns

00:04:18.691 --> 00:04:20.593
and the White House put out
a statement that said...

00:04:27.032 --> 00:04:31.737
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:04:31.737 --> 00:04:33.939
Then just to rub it
in Trump's face even more,

00:04:33.939 --> 00:04:35.408
they tweeted it, you know.

00:04:35.408 --> 00:04:38.177
[ Laughter ]

00:04:38.177 --> 00:04:40.179
But this is nice --
according to their tax return,

00:04:40.179 --> 00:04:44.316
the Bidens gave over $30,000
to charity, yeah.

00:04:44.316 --> 00:04:46.419
It was an offshoot
of Big Brothers Big Sisters,

00:04:46.419 --> 00:04:48.487
called
Big Bidens Little Carters.

00:04:48.487 --> 00:04:52.925
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:04:52.925 --> 00:04:54.360
Some news from overseas --

00:04:54.360 --> 00:04:57.296
I read that Kim Jong-un
has banned citizens

00:04:57.296 --> 00:05:00.198
from having mullets
or wearing skinny jeans.

00:05:00.198 --> 00:05:04.636
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:05:04.636 --> 00:05:05.972
Right now, everyone's like,
"I can't believe

00:05:05.972 --> 00:05:07.673
I'm saying this,
but I agree with Kim Jong-un."

00:05:07.673 --> 00:05:10.176
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:05:10.176 --> 00:05:11.844
I mean, come on,
compared to Kim Jong-un,

00:05:11.844 --> 00:05:13.779
all pants are skinny pants.
Look at this.

00:05:13.779 --> 00:05:17.450
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:05:17.450 --> 00:05:19.719
Let me see that picture again.

00:05:19.719 --> 00:05:20.887
-Come on.

00:05:20.887 --> 00:05:23.523
-His waist and his leg hole
are both size 38.

00:05:23.523 --> 00:05:26.392
[ Laughter ]

00:05:26.392 --> 00:05:28.160
Listen to this --
according to a new report,

00:05:28.160 --> 00:05:31.296
some U.S. airlines may start
weighing passengers

00:05:31.296 --> 00:05:32.664
before they board their flight.

00:05:32.664 --> 00:05:34.167
[ Booing ]

00:05:34.167 --> 00:05:35.334
You know
Americans will be like --

00:05:35.334 --> 00:05:36.368
[ Surfer voice ]
Wait, let me take off my mask

00:05:36.368 --> 00:05:37.637
and see if that makes
a difference

00:05:37.637 --> 00:05:39.305
because, you know,
I've been wearing it all day.

00:05:39.305 --> 00:05:41.874
It's like four pounds
of mask weight, so.

00:05:41.874 --> 00:05:44.476
[ Laughter ]

00:05:44.476 --> 00:05:45.711
Now, when you get
to the airport,

00:05:45.711 --> 00:05:47.480
you get searched and weighed.

00:05:47.480 --> 00:05:48.848
We're basically
a urine sample away

00:05:48.848 --> 00:05:50.049
from it being a full physical.

00:05:50.049 --> 00:05:52.384
[ Laughter ]

00:05:52.384 --> 00:05:53.752
It's not as bad as it sounds.

00:05:53.752 --> 00:05:55.821
You just discreetly step
on a scale

00:05:55.821 --> 00:05:57.990
and then, the pilot announces it
to everyone onboard.

00:05:57.990 --> 00:06:00.493
"Okay, Jerry weighs 310 pounds."

00:06:00.493 --> 00:06:01.928
[ Laughter ]

00:06:01.928 --> 00:06:03.463
Some celebrity news --
over the weekend,

00:06:03.463 --> 00:06:05.164
Ariana Grande surprised everyone

00:06:05.164 --> 00:06:07.699
and got married
in a small ceremony. Hey!

00:06:07.699 --> 00:06:09.068
[ Cheering and applause ]

00:06:09.068 --> 00:06:11.037
We love you, Ariana!
We love Ariana.

00:06:11.037 --> 00:06:13.205
[ Applause ]

00:06:13.205 --> 00:06:14.974
It was the only wedding
where the priest said,

00:06:14.974 --> 00:06:16.943
"We will now exchange
these seven rings."

00:06:16.943 --> 00:06:18.911
[ Laughter ]

00:06:18.911 --> 00:06:21.113
And, finally,
I was watching MSNBC yesterday

00:06:21.113 --> 00:06:24.917
and something pretty unfortunate
happened to a cyclist

00:06:24.917 --> 00:06:27.853
taking a selfie behind the
reporter. Watch this.

00:06:27.853 --> 00:06:29.889
-And we know
that these changes --

00:06:29.889 --> 00:06:32.158
-Oh!
-Oh, boy.

00:06:32.158 --> 00:06:33.259
[ Laughter ]

00:06:33.259 --> 00:06:35.127
Yeah.
Her friends were like,

00:06:35.127 --> 00:06:37.163
"Well, on the bright side,
your selfie's trending."

00:06:37.163 --> 00:06:40.365
Did you guys hear
about Andrew Giuliani?

00:06:40.365 --> 00:06:41.700
He's Rudy Giuliani's son.

00:06:41.700 --> 00:06:45.370
Well, he's running for governor
of New York in 2022.

00:06:45.370 --> 00:06:46.606
-Ooh.
-And get this --

00:06:46.606 --> 00:06:49.709
he's already testing out
some campaign slogans.

00:06:49.709 --> 00:06:52.912
First up, there's --
-Oh, here we go!

00:06:52.912 --> 00:06:55.547
[ Laughter ]

00:06:55.547 --> 00:06:57.016
What's up?

00:06:57.016 --> 00:07:00.186
-Let me guess -- you're going
to make fun of Andrew Giuliani

00:07:00.186 --> 00:07:03.255
by saying a bunch
of fake slogans.

00:07:03.255 --> 00:07:04.490
-Yeah, I mean,
that was the plan.

00:07:04.490 --> 00:07:06.158
[ Laughter ]
And then,

00:07:06.158 --> 00:07:08.694
each slogan is going
to pop up as a graphic,

00:07:08.694 --> 00:07:11.864
so everybody can see it
and laugh about it.

00:07:11.864 --> 00:07:13.165
[ Laughter ]

00:07:13.165 --> 00:07:15.367
-Right. I often tell jokes
about the news.

00:07:15.367 --> 00:07:18.270
-I know exactly
how this will go down.

00:07:18.270 --> 00:07:20.372
The top of the screen
is going to have a picture

00:07:20.372 --> 00:07:22.208
of Andrew Giuliani
and it'll say...

00:07:24.309 --> 00:07:27.713
[ Laughter ]
And then, underneath that,
you'll list stuff, like...

00:07:30.483 --> 00:07:32.518
[ Laughter ]

00:07:32.518 --> 00:07:34.053
-Yeah.
-Or...

00:07:37.022 --> 00:07:38.156
[ Laughter ]
-Yes. That's right.

00:07:38.156 --> 00:07:39.725
-And then, and then...

00:07:41.126 --> 00:07:43.562
[ Laughter ]
And then, you'll show

00:07:43.562 --> 00:07:45.731
a photo of his dad
with his hair dye leaking

00:07:45.731 --> 00:07:48.434
and then you'll do
-Yeah, yeah, yeah.

00:07:48.434 --> 00:07:50.436
-a few more slogans, like...

00:07:51.670 --> 00:07:53.139
[ Laughter ]
Or...

00:07:55.508 --> 00:07:56.943
And then you'll end it, I guess,

00:07:56.943 --> 00:07:58.544
with something on the nose,
like...

00:08:01.379 --> 00:08:02.514
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:08:02.514 --> 00:08:04.182
Is that how it's going to go?

00:08:04.182 --> 00:08:05.284
-You nailed it.

00:08:05.284 --> 00:08:06.786
-That's a fun bit, man.
You should do it.

00:08:06.786 --> 00:08:09.021
[ Laughter ]
-Great. We'll do it tomorrow.

